{"id":"105ca7a585f377f9","group":"17","path":"17/17-df-theory-preservation.md","title":"Preservation of Theories","display":"df-theory-preservation — Preservation of Theories","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-df-theory-preservation","aliases":["17-df-theory-preservation"],"display":"df-theory-preservation — Preservation of Theories","depends_on":["[[17-df-model]]","[[17-df-elementary-substructure]]","[[17-df-chain-union]]"],"label_origin":"local-descriptive-label","source_section":"3.2","source_result":"Unnumbered theory-preservation definitions at beginning of section","source_pages_print":[147],"source_pages_djvu":[163],"source_verification":"definitions compared in supplied DjVu OCR; local nonempty-linear-index presentation","verification_date":"2026-10-13"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-df-theory-preservation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-df-theory-preservation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-theory-preservation — Preservation of Theories"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"53255a372e5c1ee8\" href=\"?note=53255a372e5c1ee8\" title=\"17-df-model\">17-df-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"71ede582cb78a069\" href=\"?note=71ede582cb78a069\" title=\"17-df-elementary-substructure\">17-df-elementary-substructure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"cbea1b33aeed1412\" href=\"?note=cbea1b33aeed1412\" title=\"17-df-chain-union\">17-df-chain-union</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-descriptive-label"},{"key":"source_section","html":"3.2"},{"key":"source_result","html":"Unnumbered theory-preservation definitions at beginning of section"},{"key":"source_pages_print","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>147</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pages_djvu","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>163</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"definitions compared in supplied DjVu OCR; local nonempty-linear-index presentation"},{"key":"verification_date","html":"2026-10-13"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 是固定的一阶语言，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Mod}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Mod}(T)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models\">\\(\\models\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"53255a372e5c1ee8\" href=\"?note=53255a372e5c1ee8\" title=\"17-df-model\">17-df-model</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\subseteq_L\">\\(\\subseteq_L\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"71ede582cb78a069\" href=\"?note=71ede582cb78a069\" title=\"17-df-elementary-substructure\">17-df-elementary-substructure</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ChainUnion}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{ChainUnion}_L\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"cbea1b33aeed1412\" href=\"?note=cbea1b33aeed1412\" title=\"17-df-chain-union\">17-df-chain-union</a>。\n量化的指标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 为集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\">\\(&lt;\\)</span> 为其二元关系，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I}\">\\((\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I}\\)</span> 为定义域恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 的结构族；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ChainUnion}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{ChainUnion}_L\\)</span> 已要求非空线序及相容子结构链。以下引入二个以理论为参数的元语言谓词。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{SubstructurePreservedTheory}_L(T)\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathfrak A\\subseteq_L\\mathfrak B\\land\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Mod}(T)\n\\to\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Mod}(T)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\operatorname{ChainUnionPreservedTheory}_L(T)\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall I\\,\\forall{&lt;}\\,\\forall(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I}\\,\\forall\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\;\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\bigl(\\operatorname{ChainUnion}_L(I,&lt;,(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I},\\mathfrak B)\n\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;(\\mathfrak A_i\\in\\mathrm{Mod}(T))\n\\to\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Mod}(T)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{SubstructurePreservedTheory}_L(T)\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathfrak A\\subseteq_L\\mathfrak B\\land\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Mod}(T)\n\\to\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Mod}(T)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\operatorname{ChainUnionPreservedTheory}_L(T)\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall I\\,\\forall{&lt;}\\,\\forall(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I}\\,\\forall\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\;\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\bigl(\\operatorname{ChainUnion}_L(I,&lt;,(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I},\\mathfrak B)\n\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;(\\mathfrak A_i\\in\\mathrm{Mod}(T))\n\\to\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Mod}(T)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书印刷 p.147（DjVu 163）先定义理论的保持性。本库已有的 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"7820ef81342beb1d\" href=\"?note=7820ef81342beb1d\" title=\"17-df-preserved\">17-df-preserved</a> 与 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"ba56c3cb1dd7ec8d\" href=\"?note=ba56c3cb1dd7ec8d\" title=\"17-df-chain-union-preservation\">17-df-chain-union-preservation</a> 接收单个句子，不能直接接收理论。理论层的链保持性也不能改写成每个原公理分别具有单句保持性：各阶段须同时满足整个理论。这里只补缺少的参数接口，不重复已有句子定义。原书采用序数指标；非空线序表述与原书在一阶理论上的结论一致，前向由有限见证论证，逆向可限制到序数链。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"53255a372e5c1ee8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-elementary-substructure","status":"resolved","id":"71ede582cb78a069","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-elementary-substructure]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-chain-union","status":"resolved","id":"cbea1b33aeed1412","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-chain-union]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"53255a372e5c1ee8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L$ 是固定的一阶语言，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$。$\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$、$\\mathrm{Mod}(T)$ 与 $\\models$ 见 [[17-df-model]]；$\\subseteq_L$ 见 [[17-df-elementary-substructure]]；$\\operatorname{ChainUnion}_L$ 见 [[17-df-chain-union]]。\n量化的指标 $I$ 为集合，$<$ 为其二元关系，$(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I}$ 为定义域恰为 $I$ 的结构族；$\\operatorname{ChainUnion}_L$ 已要求非空线序及相容子结构链。以下引入二个以理论为参数的元语言谓词。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-elementary-substructure","status":"resolved","id":"71ede582cb78a069","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L$ 是固定的一阶语言，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$。$\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$、$\\mathrm{Mod}(T)$ 与 $\\models$ 见 [[17-df-model]]；$\\subseteq_L$ 见 [[17-df-elementary-substructure]]；$\\operatorname{ChainUnion}_L$ 见 [[17-df-chain-union]]。\n量化的指标 $I$ 为集合，$<$ 为其二元关系，$(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I